From 0936193302bb83ba9ef81ba76236d647fdac353f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] xiaomi: import topaz-t-oss changes on top of
 KERNEL.PLATFORM.2.0.r1-22800-kernel.0

Diff of MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource@topaz-t-oss against its CLO base
KERNEL.PLATFORM.2.0.r1-06900-kernel.0, re-applied onto r1-22800
(5.15.194, ACK android13-5.15-2025-12_r1 = same KMI release as the
stock sapphire GKI android13-5.15-2025-12_r9).

Conflict resolution:
- keep CLO for backported fixes (adsprpc, ufs-qcom, sdhci-msm, walt, usb audio qmi)
- drop topaz i2c-geni hardcoded GPIO bus recovery hack
- keep both for minidump last_kmsg, snps-hs panel_info, misc Kconfig, spidev ids
- qcom_q6v5: CLO tracing + Xiaomi SSR reason bookkeeping
- qti_power_supply_iio.h: Xiaomi IDs renumbered after CLO block
- (sapphire_GKI.config comes with the following commit)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
